│       └── Human-Human Collaboration ─ 关系值 (emergent)
│
├── Quality Assessment（质量维度簇）
│   ├── QA1: Is the paper based on research? ─ 3 级评分 [Table 2, §3.3]
│   ├── QA2: Clear statement of aims? ─ 3 级评分
